Modifications and enhancements:
1. Re-architected project from MFC God Object to Hexagonal Architecture (Ports & Adapters).
2. Decoupled core business domain (Note, NoteItem, AppSetting) into pure POCO models from Win32 and MFC dependencies.
3. Implemented high-performance SQLite Repository (SqliteNoteRepository) with WAL mode, composite covering indexes, 2-query batch loading, PreparedStatement caching pool, and incremental vacuum compaction.
4. Implemented full lifecycle states: Recycle Bin (soft delete, restore, clear) and Archive Box (archive, unarchive).
5. Modernized UI with Microsoft Edge WebView2 and Vue 3 + Pinia state management layer with native CSS virtualization.
6. Implemented strong-typed bidirectional IPC contracts across C++ and TypeScript.

